Section tables of a CC0 human body for the procedural lofts (epic #15150, #15299).

`body_sections.json` is derived, by `build_body_sections.py` with
`section_settings.json`, from MakeHuman files that are all CC0 1.0
(public-domain dedication). It holds measurements only (widths, depths, girths
and fitted exponents of cross-sections); no mesh, skeleton or weight data is
stored. The licence text and MakeHuman's own statement are the ones the hand
asset carries: `../hand_cc0/LICENSE.CC0.txt` and
`../hand_cc0/SOURCE_LICENSE_STATEMENT.txt`.

Source repository: https://github.com/makehumancommunity/makehuman
Source commit: a8bc2d54ff0ac92e78ff71431b1023eda42bf482

| File | Role | Licence marker |
| --- | --- | --- |
| makehuman/data/3dobjs/base.obj | hm08 base mesh; the skin that is sliced | "This asset was explicitly released as CC0 in september 2020." (file header) |
| makehuman/data/rigs/default.mhskel | joints that give each segment its axis | `"license": "CC0"` in the file |
| makehuman/data/rigs/default_weights.mhw | skin weights that decide which skin belongs to a segment | `"license": "CC0"` in the file |
| makehuman/data/targets/macrodetails/\*.target | macro morph targets of the male athletic mix | "This asset was explicitly released as CC0 in september 2020." (file header; the reader refuses a target without it) |

MakeHuman LICENSE.md, section C: "The base mesh and proxies ... These assets
have been released under CC0 1.0 Universal." The SHA-256 of every file read,
and the weight of every target, is recorded in `body_sections.json`.

Caveat, as recorded in `../head_cc0/PROVENANCE.json`: the community-assets-wip
README says the base mesh "as imported by makeclothes or maketarget remains
AGPL"; this predates and is superseded by LICENSE.md section C and the explicit
2020-09 CC0 header in the files used here. Owner may wish to confirm.

Changes made: none to the source. The mesh is morphed by the listed targets,
scaled uniformly to the stature of the settings and measured.

Rebuild or verify (the checkout is not part of this repository):

    python3 assets/body_cc0/build_body_sections.py PATH/TO/makehuman-checkout [--check]
